    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the general business law, in relation to prohibiting the\ninclusion of a confession of judgment in a contract or agreement for a\nfinancial product or service",
    "basePrintNo": "S3851",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S3851-2019",
